// The compile-time reflection descriptors (design.md "Compile-time
// reflection").
//
// `fields_of`, `enum_values_of`, and `variants_of` already produce values of
// these types; this package gives them their written names. The compiler
// contributes all three, so `meta.Field` is the identity M4b created rather
// than a second nominal type.
//
// They remain compile-time-only: naming a descriptor type does not make a
// descriptor storable at run time.
@(public)
package meta;

// The compiler contributes:
//
//   Field       a record field: name, declared type, declaration index
//   Enum_Value  an enum member: name, value in the enum's backing type,
//               declaration index
//   Variant     a union variant: label, payload type (`Unit` when it has
//               none), declaration index
